// (y/(2 pi e))^y sqrt(2 pi/y) e^corr, divided by x (x+1) ... (y-1) and
// multiplied by (2 pi)^(y-x). Neither Gamma(x) nor (2 pi)^x is formed (they
// overflow f32 near x = 35 and x = 48), and the largest pow argument is
